// A GCounter is grow-only: it cannot move backward, so a negative increment amount is a runtime
// misuse (use PnCounter.decrement for a decrementable counter). The dispatch rejects it rather
// than silently clamping — a silent clamp would hide the bug.
// expect: error E0007 at 7:5
// expect: exit 1
use para.{crdt}
x = crdt.gcounter().increment("A", -1)
echo x.value()
